{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "id": "msg_011CfPRdZMBwqJCn5Vf6mdad", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "# The Last Keeper\n\nThe lighthouse stood on the rocky promontory like a weathered sentinel, its paint peeling in long white strips. Marcus climbed the spiral stairs for the thousandth time, his knees protesting each step. Thirty years he'd kept this light burning, watching storms roll across the Atlantic and guiding ships safely past the jagged rocks below.\n\nThe automation crew was coming Monday. They'd replace him with sensors and timers, with algorithms and satellites. He understood the logic—technology was more reliable than an old man's hands. But they couldn't understand what he understood: the sea wasn't just data points and coordinates.\n\nOn his final night, Marcus stood in the lamp room as storm clouds gathered on the horizon. The wind howled through the gallery, testing the iron railings. He lit the beacon manually, running his fingers along the Fresnel lens his predecessor had installed four decades ago. Each prism caught the flame and fractured it into a thousand rays.\n\nA fishing vessel appeared through the rain, its navigation system apparently dead, drifting toward the rocks. Marcus watched from his window as the captain spotted the lighthouse beam cutting through the darkness. The boat turned sharply, angling away from danger.\n\nHe didn't see if they made it safely to harbor. He never needed to. Over thirty years, he'd learned that some things worked on faith.\n\nMarcus descended the stairs slowly, touching the cold stone walls one last time. Behind him, the light continued its rhythmic sweep across the black water—steady, true, and wholly indifferent to whether anyone was watching.\n\nHe left the key on the desk. Outside, the storm broke. Somewhere in the darkness, a ship sailed on."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 10, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4293, "cache_read_input_tokens": 21940, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4293}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "fixture-session", "timestamp": "2026-09-25T03:11:36.509Z", "request_id": "req_011CfPRdYzMwQZD3yc1nXnsJ"}
